# Only the accounts server is built as an image (packages/server/Dockerfile).
# Allowlist its inputs so source, local env files and keys never enter the
# build context. The encrypted .env.production is safe to ship; its private
# key is not.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.env.production
!packages/server
packages/server/node_modules
packages/server/dist
packages/server/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
